<h1 style="width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1; font-size: 21px; text-align: left; font-family: helvetica,arial,verdana,sans-serif; color: #555; background-color: transparent;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">First Board Meeting of the National Building Research Institute (NBRI) Successfully Convened</span></h1>
</td>
