</table>
<table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 0 5px 0;" valign="top" align="center">
<table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; font-family: lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif; color: #5c758e; padding: 0; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<p style="width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify; font-family: lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif; color: #5c758e; background-color: transparent;">The inaugural meeting of the Board of Governors of the National Building Research Institute (NBRI) was held recently under the patronage of the Chairman. This marked the first official Board meeting following the transition of the National Building Research Organisation (NBRO) into the National Building Research Institute, subsequent to the enactment of the NBRI Act No. 25 of 2025 by the Parliament of Sri Lanka.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
