<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 21px; text-align: left; font-family: helvetica,arial,verdana,sans-serif; color: #555; padding: 5px 0 5px 0; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<h1 style="width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1; font-size: 21px; text-align: left; font-family: helvetica,arial,verdana,sans-serif; color: #555; background-color: transparent;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">Cyclone "Ditwah": NBRI at the Forefront of Landslide Risk Management and Recovery</span></h1>
</td>
