<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; font-family: lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif; color: #5c758e; padding: 0; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<p style="width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; font-family: lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif; color: #5c758e; background-color: transparent;">The GeoAI Lab at the National Building Research Institution (NBRI) conducted a UAV-based radiometric thermal survey to evaluate the temporal variation of surface temperatures across the fire-affected area of the Karadiyana waste dumping site. To ensure data consistency, surveys were conducted at 07:00 AM on April 18, 20, and 22, 2026, under uniform environmental conditions.</p>
