<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; font-family: lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif; color: #5c758e; padding: 0; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<div style="width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; font-family: lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif; color: #5c758e; background-color: transparent;" class="elm">
<div>A productive discussion was held on 23 April 2026 at the National Building Research Institute (NBRI) with representatives of the Japan International Cooperation Agency, with the participation of the NBRI Director General and other senior officials.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>The discussion focused on potential collaboration to enhance landslide risk management, including promoting Community Based Disaster Risk Management (CBDRM) at the local level. This partnership is expected to strengthen community safety and contribute to building long-term resilience.</div>
</div>
