<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 21px; text-align: left; font-family: helvetica,arial,verdana,sans-serif; color: #555; padding: 5px 0 5px 0; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<h1 style="width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1; font-size: 21px; text-align: left; font-family: helvetica,arial,verdana,sans-serif; color: #555; background-color: transparent;"><span style="font-size: 24px;">NBRI and ADPC Host Seminar on International Best Practices for Post-Ditwah Landslide Rehabilitation</span></h1>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 0 5px 0;" valign="top" align="center">
<table role="presentation" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; font-family: lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif; color: #5c758e; padding: 0; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<div style="width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; font-family: lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif; color: #5c758e; background-color: transparent;" class="elm">
<div>The National Building Research Institute (NBRI), in collaboration with the Asian Disaster Preparedness Center (ADPC), successfully conducted a seminar on "International best practices in Landslide Risk Management for Post Ditwah Rehabilitation of Landslide-Affected Areas and Communities in Sri Lanka".</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>This seminar was organized as a critical response to the devastation caused by Cyclone "Ditwah", which made landfall in Sri Lanka on November 27, 2025. The cyclone brought exceptionally heavy rainfall, triggering widespread flooding and severe landslides that resulted in significant displacement and damage to infrastructure. NBRI identified ADPC as a key international partner to support the rehabilitation efforts, leveraging ADPC’s four decades of experience and expertise in landslide risk management through the RECLAIM program.</div>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
