<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 0 20px 0;" valign="top" align="center">
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #756a64; padding: 0 5px 0 15px; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<div style="width: 100%; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #756a64; background-color: transparent;">
<div>We are pleased to announce the successful conclusion of the collaborative research project between Swisstek Ceylon PLC and the National Building Research Organisation (NBRO), focused on developing construction grout materials.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>The project closure meeting was successfully held on Friday, October 31, 2025, marking the formal end of the development phase. The meeting took place at the NBRO Auditorium, with key representatives from both Swisstek Ceylon PLC and the NBRO's Building Material Research and Testing Division in attendance.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>The results of this partnership are expected to significantly contribute to the development of high-quality construction practices across the industry.</div>
</div>
