</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 2px; text-align: center; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #4f3a2e; padding: 0 0 10px 0; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<div style="width: 100%; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 2px; text-align: center; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #4f3a2e; background-color: transparent;"><span style="font-size: 22px;">Building Knowledge on Disaster Management: Mawathagama Central College Students Visit NBRO</span></div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 0 20px 0;" valign="top" align="center">
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #756a64; padding: 0 5px 0 15px; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<div style="width: 100%; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #756a64; background-color: transparent;">
<div>Mawathagama Central College recently organized an educational visit to the National Building Research Organisation (NBRO) for its grade 12 and 13 geography students. The primary objective of this visit was to provide the students with a comprehensive understanding of NBRO's services, focusing particularly on landslide and disaster risk reduction.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>The program included a series of informative sessions, beginning with an introduction to NBRO’s services. Experts shared in-depth knowledge on landslide identification, mapping, and mitigation strategies. Students learned about the locations, vulnerable to landslides, the causes behind these disasters, and the various effective mitigation measures in place. They were provided with an overview of the landslide early warning systems employed by NBRO to ensure public safety and preparedness in areas at risk.</div>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
