</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 2px; text-align: center; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #4f3a2e; padding: 0 0 10px 0; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<div style="width: 100%; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 2px; text-align: center; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #4f3a2e; background-color: transparent;"><span style="font-size: 22px;">Senior Officials from MOD, DPMM, Railways and NBRO Inspect Landslide Mitigation Sites along Upcountry Railway Line</span></div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 0 20px 0;" valign="top" align="center">
<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 16px; text-align: center; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #756a64; padding: 0 5px 0 15px; background-color: null;" valign="top" align="center">
<div style="width: 100%; font-weight: 400; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #756a64; background-color: transparent;">
<div>A two-day field visit was conducted on August 29 - 30, 2025 under the Reduction of Landslide Vulnerability by Mitigation Measures Project (RLVMMP) to monitor the progress of landslide mitigation sites located along the upcountry railway line from Rambukkana to Haliela.</div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>The visit was attended by senior officials including the Director General and representatives of the Department of Project Monitoring and Management - Ministry of Finance, the Director General – Planning of the Disaster Management Division, Ministry of Defence, officials of Sri Lanka Railways, the Director General of NBRO along with NBRO officials, and the Project Director and PMU staff of RLVMMP.</div>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
