<div style="width: 100%; font-weight: bold; display: block; line-height: 1.5; font-size: 2px; text-align: center; font-family: lato,helvetica,arial,sans-serif; color: #4f3a2e; background-color: transparent;"><span style="font-size: 22px;">Educational Visit to NBRO Enhances Disaster Risk Reduction Training for Sri Lanka Air Force Trainees</span></div>
